"Ask Again for Declined Folders" = "对已拒绝的文件夹重新询问";
"Check Again" = "重新检测";
"Disable qmd Index" = "停用 qmd 索引";
"Embeddings are up to date" = "嵌入已是最新";
"Found on your login shell’s PATH" = "从登录 shell 的 PATH 中查找";
"Install qmd (needs Node.js 22 or later, or Bun), and Homebrew’s SQLite, which qmd’s vector extension needs:" = "安装 qmd（需要 Node.js 22 或更新版本，或 Bun），以及 qmd 向量扩展需要的 Homebrew SQLite：";
"Looking for qmd…" = "正在查找 qmd…";
"No folder uses qmd yet: open the search panel in a folder first" = "还没有文件夹使用 qmd：请先在某个文件夹里打开搜索面板";
"Path to qmd" = "qmd 路径";
"Register “%@” as qmd collection “%@”?" = "把“%1$@”注册为 qmd collection“%2$@”？";
"Register" = "注册";
"Rerank results (another model, slower)" = "重排结果（需要另一个模型，更慢）";
"Return in the search field, or the sparkles button, asks qmd for documents with a similar meaning. Turning this on sets it up in the background: qmd downloads about 1.6 GB of models into its cache (~/.cache/qmd/models; reranking adds about 0.6 GB) and embeds each folder you search. The search panel shows the progress, and keyword search works meanwhile. Each semantic search then takes seconds." = "在搜索框按回车或点星光按钮，让 qmd 找意思相近的文档。打开后会在后台准备：qmd 下载约 1.6 GB 模型到它的缓存目录（~/.cache/qmd/models；重排另需约 0.6 GB），并为你搜索的每个文件夹生成嵌入。搜索面板会显示进度，期间关键词搜索照常可用。之后每次语义搜索需要几秒。";
"Searches folders with your installed qmd (keyword and optional semantic search) instead of the built-in search." = "用你安装的 qmd 搜索文件夹（关键词搜索，可选语义搜索），代替内置搜索。";
"Semantic search failed: %@" = "语义搜索失败：%@";
"Semantic search" = "语义搜索";
"The index is not refreshed automatically because “qmd update” would also run the update command of: %@. Run “qmd update” in Terminal when files have changed." = "索引不会自动刷新：“qmd update”还会运行以下 collection 的更新命令：%@。文件改动后请在终端运行“qmd update”。";
"Update Embeddings Now" = "立即更新嵌入";
"Update embeddings while the Mac is idle" = "Mac 空闲时更新嵌入";
"Use Built-in Search" = "使用内置搜索";
"qmd %@ at %@ is older than 2.8; the built-in search is used." = "%2$@ 的 qmd %1$@ 低于 2.8，使用内置搜索。";
"qmd Search" = "qmd 搜索";
"qmd did not answer within %lld s" = "qmd 在 %lld 秒内没有响应";
"qmd exited with status %d" = "qmd 退出，状态码 %d";
"qmd failed (%@); the built-in search is used." = "qmd 出错（%@），使用内置搜索。";
"qmd is not installed; the built-in search is used. Settings ▸ Extensions ▸ qmd Search says how to install it." = "未安装 qmd，使用内置搜索。安装方法见 设置 ▸ 扩展 ▸ qmd 搜索。";
"qmd keeps one index for all your collections. A folder is added to it only after you agree, as a collection that your own qmd searches leave out; right-click the folder in the sidebar to remove it again." = "qmd 的所有 collection 共用一个索引。只有经你同意，文件夹才会作为一个不参与你自己 qmd 默认查询的 collection 加入；在侧栏右键该文件夹可以再移除。";
"qmd printed no version (“%@”)" = "qmd 没有输出版本号（“%@”）";
"qmd will write the contents of these files to its local index %@, which your other qmd collections share. MacDown2.0 sets the collection to stay out of your default qmd searches in Terminal." = "qmd 会把这些文件的内容写入它的本地索引 %@（与你其他 qmd collection 共用）。MacDown2.0 会把它设为不参与你在终端里的默认查询。";
"qmd" = "qmd";
"qmd’s answer could not be read" = "无法读取 qmd 的输出";
"qmd’s best matches are all outside this folder (its collection covers a parent folder)" = "qmd 排名最前的结果都在这个文件夹之外（它的 collection 覆盖的是上级文件夹）";
"“%@” is not an executable qmd; the built-in search is used." = "“%@”不是可执行的 qmd，使用内置搜索。";
"Semantic search is still being set up; keyword search works meanwhile." = "语义搜索还在准备中；期间关键词搜索照常可用。";
"Semantic search setup was stopped." = "语义搜索的准备已停止。";
"Semantic search setup failed: %@" = "语义搜索准备失败：%@";
"another “qmd embed” is running; try again when it has finished" = "另一个“qmd embed”正在运行，请等它结束后重试";
"Preparing semantic search…" = "正在准备语义搜索…";
"Preparing semantic search: embedding 1 document…" = "正在准备语义搜索：为 1 个文档生成嵌入…";
"Preparing semantic search: embedding %lld documents…" = "正在准备语义搜索：为 %lld 个文档生成嵌入…";
"Preparing semantic search: loading the models…" = "正在准备语义搜索：加载模型…";
"Preparing semantic search: downloading qmd’s models (%@ of %@)…" = "正在准备语义搜索：下载 qmd 的模型（%1$@ / %2$@）…";
"Preparing semantic search: embedding the folder’s documents…" = "正在准备语义搜索：为文件夹里的文档生成嵌入…";
